    "updated_at": "2022-10-27T16:39:56Z",
    "body": "I added a commit to also fix the signature for synchronous fetching, by removing synchronous fetching (since it's not supported anymore) and pausing while waiting for the result of a normal fetch.\r\n\r\nSince there is now a single type of fetch, I reverted part of https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/8328: there is now again a single \"perform the fetch\" hook type, which accepts a callback that takes response and bytes. This is exactly how it works for the default fetch.",
